# Free LLM API

This project is a starter backend for a FreeLLMAPI-compatible service.

## Features
- JWT/API key authentication
- health check
- list available models
- chat completion endpoint
- conversation history endpoint
- rate limiting ready (middleware hook)

## Environment
Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your values.

FREE_LLM_API_BASE_URL=https://api.free-llm.com
FREE_LLM_API_KEY=your-free-llm-key
JWT_SECRET=change-me
API_KEY=change-me
PORT=3000
